The winemetal bridge in this directory (bridge/) is a modified copy of DXMT's
src/winemetal (https://github.com/3Shain/dxmt). Like DXMT, it is licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option)
any later version. The full license text is in COPYING.LIB.

Files changed from DXMT carry a notice saying so; bridge/UPSTREAM lists the
changes, and the git history has every change with its date. The files that
d9mt added to this directory (d9mtair_thunks.*, winecrt0_compat.c,
unix/dxso_stubs.c, unix/exports.list, tests/) are also distributed under
these terms as part of the bridge.

winemetal.so statically links LLVM (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception) and
dxbc-spirv (MIT). Apache-2.0 is compatible with LGPL-3.0, which the "or any
later version" option allows for that combination. Binary distributions
must include these notices; see ../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and ../LICENSES/.

